05:32:46,030 --> 05:32:49,210
If lost, all owned weapons can be recovered at a locker.

7553
05:32:51,150 --> 05:32:51,630
All right.

7554
05:32:51,750 --> 05:32:52,390
So, sort of.

7555
05:32:53,990 --> 05:32:54,670
Not bad.

7556
05:32:55,690 --> 05:32:56,790
Let me take off this glass.

7557
05:32:56,950 --> 05:32:57,970
I look like a jackass.

7558
05:33:00,130 --> 05:33:00,810
There we go.

7559
05:33:05,190 --> 05:33:06,190
