Why not?

7566
05:33:25,010 --> 05:33:25,830
And why not?

7567
05:33:26,190 --> 05:33:27,150
Finish it off with a beer.

7568
05:33:30,510 --> 05:33:32,110
I did my good deed, didn't I?

7569
05:33:34,870 --> 05:33:38,750
I love the whole system with the bottles and stuff like that, you know?

7570
05:33:41,170 --> 05:33:42,610
Like, how cool is that?

7571
05:33:42,730 --> 05:33:43,610
Come on, man!

7572
05:33:44,510 --> 05:33:45,310
Fucking hell.

7573
05:33:47,030 --> 05:33:47,470
Jeez.

7574
05:33:50,830 --> 05:33:51,730
Let's get out of here.

7575
