7577
05:33:56,610 --> 05:33:58,290
This trunk was open before, wasn't it?

7578
05:33:58,910 --> 05:34:00,270
Oh, that's probably where they had them.

7579
05:34:00,350 --> 05:34:00,950
They had them in here.

7580
05:34:02,370 --> 05:34:03,670
Clear and stow bag.

7581
05:34:05,050 --> 05:34:05,810
Just leave it.

7582
05:34:08,250 --> 05:34:09,830
Let's put my bag in the trunk.

7583
05:34:12,290 --> 05:34:13,030
Just in case.

7584
05:34:16,610 --> 05:34:17,350
There we go.

7585
05:34:25,530 --> 05:34:27,130
Yo, I kind of want to explore this place.

7586
05:34:34,230 --> 05:34:35,330
I want to go on that roof.

7587
