Don't fucking talk.

7592
05:34:46,670 --> 05:34:48,130
You're from the government, huh?

7593
05:34:48,490 --> 05:34:49,570
Ain't you, huh?

7594
05:34:50,490 --> 05:34:50,930
Okay.

7595
05:34:51,670 --> 05:34:52,170
No worries.

7596
05:34:53,930 --> 05:34:55,630
It was rummaging through the trash.

7597
05:34:56,070 --> 05:34:56,790
Oh, okay.

7598
05:34:57,070 --> 05:34:58,250
In no way.

7599
05:35:00,590 --> 05:35:01,110
Man.

7600
05:35:02,670 --> 05:35:03,610
It was in there.

7601
05:35:03,830 --> 05:35:04,090
Ugh.

7602
05:35:04,670 --> 05:35:06,050
Dude, I can smell it from here.

7603
05:35:07,430 --> 05:35:08,970
Nothing worse than trash.

7604
05:35:09,350 --> 05:35:10,690
That's been sitting there forever.

7605
05:35:12,150 --> 05:35:13,530
Especially on a hot day, you know.

7606
05:35:19,870 --> 05:35:20,510
Home finally.

7607
05:35:20,650 --> 05:35:22,090
Gonna shower and lie down for a minute.

7608
05:35:22,230 --> 05:35:22,550
I'm cooked.

7609
05:35:25,870 --> 05:35:26,610
I'm heading home.

7610
05:35:28,830 --> 05:35:29,430
Chill a little.

7611
05:35:29,630 --> 05:35:30,170
I'll be back in a bit.

7612
05:35:32,930 --> 05:35:33,250
Okay.

7613
05:35:47,630 --> 05:35:51,230
Dude, they even have the pee on the wall.

7614
05:35:52,430 --> 05:35:54,710
That's how much detail they have in this game.

7615
05:35:55,330 --> 05:35:57,450
You see the yellow pee on the wall.

7616
05:36:00,290 --> 05:36:01,130
That's amazing.

7617
05:36:03,170 --> 05:36:05,390
Also, what is that, uh, sign right there?

7618
05:36:08,330 --> 05:36:10,970
Wasn't there a way to sort of highlight things in 3D space?

7619
05:36:10,970 --> 05:36:12,090
How did I do that again?

7620
05:36:12,190 --> 05:36:12,310
Oh.

7621
05:36:17,770 --> 05:36:19,590
Are we about to have a problem down here?

7622
05:36:21,270 --> 05:36:21,710
Okay.

7623
05:36:30,750 --> 05:36:31,290
Let's go.

7624
05:36:33,110 --> 05:36:34,190
Can I maybe slide?

7625
05:36:34,490 --> 05:36:35,350
Okay, I can jump.

7626
05:36:38,690 --> 05:36:39,850
Oh yeah, my car's over here.

7627
05:36:39,990 --> 05:36:41,330
I thought someone stole my car.

7628
05:36:44,890 --> 05:36:46,330
Don't worry about it.

7629
