He started walking faster.

7630
05:37:05,930 --> 05:37:06,650
No, no, no, no, no.

7631
05:37:06,770 --> 05:37:08,030
Oh, we gotta get on that highway up there.

7632
05:37:09,810 --> 05:37:10,290
Uh...

7633
05:37:10,290 --> 05:37:11,650
Let's find our way up.

7634
05:37:17,370 --> 05:37:18,430
I'm taking this way.

7635
05:37:20,630 --> 05:37:22,650
Well, that's for the off-ramp that way.

7636
05:37:24,310 --> 05:37:25,510
Let me turn right here.

7637
05:37:27,930 --> 05:37:28,830
Sorry, bros.

7638
05:37:31,850 --> 05:37:32,870
I know, I know.

7639
05:37:35,590 --> 05:37:37,510
This is me being a little bit of a crime rider.

7640
05:37:38,030 --> 05:37:39,510
I told Lucia I'd be home, right?

7641
05:37:44,930 --> 05:37:46,010
And I'm coming home.

7642
05:37:48,550 --> 05:37:50,190
We're gonna go max speed on this.

7643
05:37:51,950 --> 05:37:52,930
No scratches.

7644
05:37:53,170 --> 05:37:53,630
Max speed.

7645
05:37:54,230 --> 05:37:56,450
I'm gonna activate my spider senses.

7646
05:38:03,630 --> 05:38:04,990
Can I just keep it on forever?

7647
05:38:05,590 --> 05:38:06,930
No, it's probably the focus, isn't it?

7648
05:38:09,330 --> 05:38:09,610
Oh!

7649
05:38:10,930 --> 05:38:11,450
Oh, no, wait.

7650
05:38:11,510 --> 05:38:11,830
I paid.

7651
05:38:11,950 --> 05:38:12,550
Okay, okay, good.

7652
05:38:14,790 --> 05:38:15,290
Uh, wait.

7653
05:38:15,330 --> 05:38:16,290
I'm not getting off yet, am I?

7654
05:38:17,830 --> 05:38:18,750
A little too early.

7655
05:38:20,430 --> 05:38:21,330
A little too early.

7656
05:38:22,370 --> 05:38:24,370
Also, did you see all those packages on the map just now?

7657
05:38:25,550 --> 05:38:27,450
Donnie has packages all over I can go grab.

7658
05:38:33,350 --> 05:38:34,690
Key Lento, Goose Key.

7659
05:38:35,550 --> 05:38:37,730
So, the place I'm living in is called Key Lento.

7660
05:38:38,330 --> 05:38:38,990
It's over there.

7661
05:38:39,130 --> 05:38:39,850
Man, look at that.

7662
05:38:42,410 --> 05:38:42,810
Fuck.

7663
05:38:46,670 --> 05:38:51,170
This is, without a doubt, the prettiest game I've ever played in my life.

7664
05:38:53,650 --> 05:38:55,030
Followed by, I think, Cyberpunk.

7665
05:38:58,010 --> 05:38:59,510
But, that's not even close.

7666
05:39:01,190 --> 05:39:04,530
I will say, though, 30 FPS does, you know, detract a little.

7667
05:39:05,490 --> 05:39:10,590
If this is, like, in 120 later on, boy.

7668
05:39:11,650 --> 05:39:12,350
Wait, what?

7669
05:39:13,130 --> 05:39:14,610
Is that because I ran a red light?

7670
05:39:16,550 --> 05:39:17,330
No way.

7671
05:39:18,130 --> 05:39:18,890
No way.

7672
05:39:22,450 --> 05:39:23,590
You just hurry home.

7673
05:39:27,370 --> 05:39:28,870
Wait, where am I going right now?

7674
05:39:29,170 --> 05:39:30,630
I don't even know my own neighborhood.

7675
05:39:35,430 --> 05:39:36,310
There we are.

7676
05:39:41,130 --> 05:39:42,790
I'm going to turn left over here.

7677
05:39:45,430 --> 05:39:46,410
Ah, crap.

7678
05:39:50,630 --> 05:39:51,170
Okay.

7679
05:39:53,190 --> 05:39:54,690
Alright, Lucia, I'm home.

7680
05:40:00,030 --> 05:40:01,410
I have three stash bags.

7681
05:40:05,590 --> 05:40:06,390
Load out.

7682
05:40:06,610 --> 05:40:07,690
Let's just deposit this guy.

7683
05:40:12,170 --> 05:40:13,270
Leave them in the car.

7684
05:40:16,290 --> 05:40:17,490
Look at all my goodies.

7685
05:40:19,230 --> 05:40:22,230
Can I put them in the place again?

7686
05:40:26,430 --> 05:40:26,750
No.

7687
05:40:29,010 --> 05:40:30,510
Okay, well, in that case...

7688
05:40:30,510 --> 05:40:31,650
I'm just going to leave them here.

7689
05:40:34,030 --> 05:40:34,610
There you go.

7690
05:40:35,150 --> 05:40:36,110
Can I drop the other one, too?

7691
05:40:37,650 --> 05:40:37,970
No?

7692
05:40:39,630 --> 05:40:39,950
Okay.

7693
05:40:40,370 --> 05:40:41,710
I'll leave them in the damn car.

7694
05:40:43,650 --> 05:40:44,310
Be that way.

7695
05:40:48,510 --> 05:40:49,730
Stole them all.

7696
05:40:53,400 --> 05:40:53,870
Okay.

7697
05:40:54,350 --> 05:40:54,990
Not bad.

7698
05:41:01,560 --> 05:41:02,610
Honey, I'm home.

7699
05:41:06,570 --> 05:41:09,210
I should close the door.

7700
05:41:16,530 --> 05:41:17,550
He was in bed, right?

7701
05:41:22,790 --> 05:41:23,610
Wait, inspect?

7702
05:41:23,830 --> 05:41:24,330
What do you mean inspect?

7703
05:41:25,790 --> 05:41:28,190
Oh, I can go first person with the flashlight.

7704
05:41:28,370 --> 05:41:28,470
Cool.

7705
05:41:30,070 --> 05:41:31,750
Making sure she's in bed.

7706
05:41:32,570 --> 05:41:34,110
I'm the sleep police, you know?

7707
05:41:34,570 --> 05:41:37,050
Gotta make sure people get their night's rest.

7708
05:41:38,010 --> 05:41:38,430
Oh.

7709
05:41:39,250 --> 05:41:39,610
Oh.

7710
05:41:41,810 --> 05:41:42,230
Okay.

7711
05:41:43,350 --> 05:41:44,950
I'm going to turn off these lights as well.

7712
05:41:47,730 --> 05:41:49,250
No, that's the wrong one.

7713
05:41:49,710 --> 05:41:50,910
It's the other one.

7714
05:41:52,170 --> 05:41:53,470
But we don't touch that one, right?

7715
05:41:53,630 --> 05:41:54,370
It's destroyed.

7716
05:41:54,850 --> 05:41:55,990
How do I turn the light off here?

7717
05:41:56,290 --> 05:41:56,530
Ah!

7718
05:41:58,850 --> 05:41:59,590
There we go.

7719
05:41:59,990 --> 05:42:01,070
I'll leave that light on.

7720
05:42:01,370 --> 05:42:04,170
Nothing worse than having to fumble around in the dark at night, you know?

7721
05:42:05,230 --> 05:42:06,570
A little bit of light is good.

7722
05:42:06,930 --> 05:42:08,130
You gotta go take a whiz.

7723
05:42:10,250 --> 05:42:10,750
Alright.

7724
05:42:12,390 --> 05:42:13,610
Lucia, don't wake up.

7725
05:42:13,870 --> 05:42:15,090
Just keep sleeping, please.

7726
05:42:16,590 --> 05:42:17,370
Don't do it.

7727
05:42:19,710 --> 05:42:20,210
Fuck!

7728
05:42:22,050 --> 05:42:24,210
Jason, why are you so loud and obnoxious?

7729
05:42:26,030 --> 05:42:26,730
Damn it.

7730
05:42:32,390 --> 05:42:33,170
Until noon.

7731
05:42:37,730 --> 05:42:39,250
There we go, man.

7732
05:42:41,810 --> 05:42:43,210
That was a long night out.

7733
05:42:44,290 --> 05:42:46,550
Maybe she's asking herself what I'm doing at light.

7734
05:42:46,930 --> 05:42:48,350
Or that late at night, you know?

7735
05:42:48,430 --> 05:42:49,630
Am I out burying a corpse?

7736
05:42:49,990 --> 05:42:50,970
In the middle of the woods?

7737
05:42:57,450 --> 05:42:58,210
Okay, guys.

7738
05:42:58,650 --> 05:42:59,650
We're going to stop here.

7739
05:42:59,730 --> 05:43:00,330
I'm going to save.

7740
05:43:02,270 --> 05:43:05,350
And this time I can actually turn off my PlayStation before next time.

7741
05:43:06,490 --> 05:43:07,590
So the game is saved.

7742
05:43:09,190 --> 05:43:09,630
Boom.

7743
05:43:13,210 --> 05:43:14,630
That was freaking awesome.

7744
05:43:14,890 --> 05:43:16,430
This game is...

7745
05:43:16,430 --> 05:43:17,270
the best.

7746
05:43:17,930 --> 05:43:19,350
I'm having such a blast with this.

7747
05:43:19,450 --> 05:43:20,850
I hope it's entertaining to watch as well.

7748
05:43:20,930 --> 05:43:22,050
I know I'm going really slow.

7749
05:43:22,670 --> 05:43:23,210
You know?

7750
05:43:23,390 --> 05:43:29,510
Like, I realize that I'm fucking around most of the time, but I am just having the time of my life with this.

7751
05:43:30,610 --> 05:43:32,390
I am having so much fun.

7752
05:43:33,290 --> 05:43:34,990
So I don't feel any remorse at all.

7753
05:43:38,930 --> 05:43:39,650
Oh, man.

7754
05:43:41,430 --> 05:43:42,430
It's great to watch?

7755
05:43:42,550 --> 05:43:43,430
Okay, that's good, though.

7756
05:43:44,570 --> 05:43:45,870
I'm enjoying how you're playing?

7757
05:43:46,010 --> 05:43:46,550
Thank you.

7758
05:43:46,910 --> 05:43:47,470
Okay, good.

7759
05:43:47,710 --> 05:43:51,210
I was afraid people were kind of hating on it, because I wasn't, you know, advancing anything.

7760
05:43:54,030 --> 05:43:55,130
Dude, the whole...

7761
05:43:55,130 --> 05:44:02,290
The whole drinking into the whole swimming to the island and punching that guy and stealing the boat was freaking sick.

7762
05:44:03,650 --> 05:44:05,350
That was some next-level stuff.

7763
05:44:05,950 --> 05:44:09,510
Emergent gameplay is, like, one of this game's strong suits, for sure.

7764
05:44:10,430 --> 05:44:11,510
Some people are mad.

7765
05:44:13,550 --> 05:44:19,270
The thing is, I'm kind of afraid of advancing the story a little bit, because I don't want this game to end.

7766
05:44:21,870 --> 05:44:22,930
I'm having such a blast.

7767
05:44:23,130 --> 05:44:24,550
I don't want this game to ever end.

7768
05:44:26,550 --> 05:44:33,270
You know, when they release Grand Theft Auto 6 online, maybe that'll be the first time I ever check out an online aspect of the game.

7769
05:44:34,070 --> 05:44:37,210
I wasn't really interested in trying out Grand Theft Auto 5 online.

7770
05:44:37,710 --> 05:44:39,950
For some reason, it just didn't really vibe with me.

7771
05:44:40,390 --> 05:44:41,690
Maybe I'll do it this time around.

7772
05:44:42,570 --> 05:44:47,190
If they do it right, and they do it in a way where it's really fun and stuff, I think it could be awesome.

7773
05:44:50,730 --> 05:44:52,210
Shirley is the choice for real.

7774
05:44:53,090 --> 05:44:54,710
Dude, Shirley is such a good character.

7775
05:44:54,710 --> 05:44:56,050
I love having her as my neighbor.

7776
05:44:58,390 --> 05:45:00,610
I think you're like 0.01%.

7777
05:45:00,610 --> 05:45:02,110
I love that you say that, man.

7778
05:45:02,570 --> 05:45:03,930
That makes me so happy.

7779
05:45:05,730 --> 05:45:07,370
I can't wait for this to come out on Steam.

7780
05:45:07,630 --> 05:45:08,230
I'm so impatient.

7781
05:45:09,730 --> 05:45:12,450
Dude, you're gonna get a sick experience on Steam, I think.

7782
05:45:12,530 --> 05:45:18,290
If you have a beast of a computer, this game needs to be punished with an RTX 5080 or something, you know?

7783
05:45:20,130 --> 05:45:22,090
Kick out your girlfriend and choose Shirley.

7784
05:45:22,870 --> 05:45:26,030
If the game allowed me to do that, it would be an automatic 12 out of 10.

7785
05:45:27,370 --> 05:45:28,210
Is this the end?

7786
05:45:28,290 --> 05:45:28,530
Yes.

7787
05:45:28,910 --> 05:45:29,630
We just...

7788
05:45:29,630 --> 05:45:30,490
We just ended.

7789
05:45:31,030 --> 05:45:33,170
It's been almost six hours, actually.

7790
05:45:33,950 --> 05:45:35,150
I was gaming today.

7791
05:45:38,490 --> 05:45:40,770
I was audio only for the last 90 minutes.

7792
05:45:41,190 --> 05:45:42,790
Roughly from the No More Shenanigans talk.

7793
05:45:42,910 --> 05:45:44,690
I can't wait to watch the Bigfoot and the cries.

7794
05:45:45,050 --> 05:45:45,310
Right?

7795
05:45:45,450 --> 05:45:46,370
Didn't that look like Bigfoot?

7796
05:45:46,450 --> 05:45:47,590
That's the first thing I thought of.

7797
05:45:48,310 --> 05:45:51,130
But that scream was like blood-curdling, man.

7798
05:45:53,270 --> 05:45:57,590
I was actually really scared when I was chasing that thing.

7799
05:46:00,550 --> 05:46:01,850
Because it was so unexpected.

7800
05:46:07,350 --> 05:46:08,810
When is next adding to calendar?

7801
05:46:09,010 --> 05:46:09,530
I don't know.

7802
05:46:09,890 --> 05:46:10,810
Tomorrow we're gonna do Minecraft.

7803
05:46:11,550 --> 05:46:18,410
And after that, we're probably gonna do KSP, because I feel like I need to advance my space program more.

7804
05:46:18,490 --> 05:46:19,410
I want to go to more planets.

7805
05:46:20,150 --> 05:46:25,610
I don't know if you're following that series, but I've been doing a lot of big exploration in that game, and I want to continue that, too.

7806
05:46:27,090 --> 05:46:29,710
So, I would say minimum three days from now.

7807
05:46:31,070 --> 05:46:34,450
Unless I'm really addicted, and I do two streams in a day with two games.

7808
05:46:34,670 --> 05:46:35,290
It could happen.

7809
05:46:36,450 --> 05:46:37,070
Could happen.

7810
05:46:43,430 --> 05:46:44,830
You play the Silksong DLC.

7811
05:46:45,150 --> 05:46:45,650
Is it out?

7812
05:46:47,930 --> 05:46:53,090
If it's big enough and, you know, and good, maybe I'll do it.

7813
05:46:53,930 --> 05:46:57,770
I usually just don't go back for games when they release a DLC.

7814
05:46:58,750 --> 05:47:03,510
Because then I have to get back into it, and, you know, I kind of lost the hype because I'm already done with the game in my mind.

7815
05:47:06,490 --> 05:47:07,790
